 API","Estilização com Tailwind CSS","Trabalho com conteúdo MDX","Estrutura de projeto personalizada"],"ru":["Разработка страниц и компонентов с React","Работа с API-маршрутами","Стилизация с Tailwind CSS","Работа с содержимым MDX","Пользовательская структура проекта для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["تطوير الصفحات والمكونات مع React","العمل مع مسارات API","التنسيق مع Tailwind CSS","العمل مع محتوى MDX","هيكل المشروع المخصص للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use nextjs-dev","nextjs-dev setup guide","nextjs-dev vs create-react-app","nextjs-dev install","what is nextjs-dev","nextjs-dev alternative","nextjs-dev tutorial","nextjs-dev documentation","nextjs-dev best practices"],"zh":["Next.js开发","Next.js设置","Next.js项目结构","Next.js API路由","Next.js Tailwind CSS","Next.js MDX","React开发","前端开发框架","Web应用程序开发"],"ja":["Next.js開発","Next.js設定","Next.jsプロジェクト構造","Next.js APIルーティング","Next.js Tailwind CSS","Next.js MDX","React開発","フロントエンド開発フレームワーク","Webアプリケーション開発"],"ko":["Next.js 개발","Next.js 설정","Next.js 프로젝트 구조","Next.js API 라우팅","Next.js Tailwind CSS","Next.js MDX","React 개발","프론트엔드 개발 프레임워크","웹 애플리케이션 개발"],"es":["Next.js","React","Tailwind CSS","MDX","API routes","Desarrollo web","Server-side rendering","Herramientas de desarrollo","Frameworks JavaScript"],"fr":["Next.js","React","Tailwind CSS","MDX","Routes API","Développement web","Rendu serveur","Outils de développement","Frameworks JavaScript"],"de":["Next.js","React","Tailwind CSS","MDX","API-Routen","Webentwicklung","Serverseitiges Rendering","Entwicklungstools","JavaScript-Frameworks"],"pt":["nextjs","react","tailwind css","mdx","desenvolvimento web","configuração nextjs","guias de nextjs","tutoriais de nextjs"],"ru":["nextjs","react","tailwind css","mdx","веб-разработка","настройка nextjs","руководства по nextjs","туториалы по nextjs для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["nextjs","react","tailwind css","mdx","تطوير الويب","إعداد nextjs","دلائل nextjs","دورات nextjs للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ihmissuti","repo":"kimmoihanus-nextjs-site","repoPath":"ihmissuti/kimmoihanus-nextjs-site","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nextjs-dev","description":"Next.js development conventions and patterns for kimmoihanus.com. Use when working on pages, components, or API routes in this project.","bodyPreview":"# Next.js Development\n\nDevelopment conventions and patterns for the kimmoihanus.com Next.js site.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating new pages or components\n- Working with API routes\n- Styling with Tailwind CSS\n- Working with MDX content\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\n/\n├── components/     # React components\n├── css/           # Stylesheets (Tailwind, Prism)\n├── graphics/      # Graphics markdown files\n├── lib/           # Utility functions and hooks\n├── pages/         # Next.js pages (file-based routing)","body":"# Next.js Development\n\nDevelopment conventions and patterns for the kimmoihanus.com Next.js site.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating new pages or components\n- Working with API routes\n- Styling with Tailwind CSS\n- Working with MDX content\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\n/\n├── components/     # React components\n├── css/           # Stylesheets (Tailwind, Prism)\n├── graphics/      # Graphics markdown files\n├── lib/           # Utility functions and hooks\n├── pages/         # Next.js pages (file-based routing)\n│   ├── api/       # API routes\n│   ├── graphics/  # Dynamic graphics pages\n│   └── posts/     # Dynamic post pages\n├── posts/         # Blog post markdown files\n├── prose/         # Static prose content\n├── public/        # Static assets\n└── tools/         # Additional tools and MCP servers\n```\n\n## Conventions\n\n### Pages\n\n- Pages use file-based routing in `/pages/`\n- Dynamic routes use `[slug].js` format\n- API routes go in `/pages/api/`\n\n### Components\n\n- Components are in `/components/`\n- Use functional components with hooks\n- Export default the main component\n\n### Styling\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes\n- Custom styles in `/css/` directory\n- Module CSS for component-specific styles (e.g., `graphics.module.css`)\n\n### Content\n\n- Blog posts: `/posts/XXX-slug.md`\n- Graphics: `/graphics/slug.md`\n- Static prose: `/prose/slug.md`\n\n## Key Libraries\n\n- `next` - Framework\n- `next-seo` - SEO configuration\n- `next-mdx-remote` - MDX rendering\n- `tailwindcss` - Styling\n- `gray-matter` - Frontmatter parsing\n\n## Development Commands\n\n```bash\n# Start development server\nnpm run dev\n\n# Build for production\nnpm run build\n\n# Start production server\nnpm run start\n\n# Generate sitemap\nnpm run postbuild\n```\n\n## Creating New Pages\n\n1. Add file to `/pages/` directory\n2. Export a default React component\n3. Optionally export `getStaticProps` or `getServerSideProps`\n\nExample:\n\n```jsx\nimport Layout from ''../components/Layout'';\nimport { NextSeo } from ''next-seo'';\n\nexport default function MyPage() {\n  return (\n    <Layout>\n      <NextSeo title=\"My Page\" />\n      <h1>My New Page</h1>\n    </Layout>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Creating API Routes\n\nAdd file to `/pages/api/`:\n\n```js\nexport default async function handler(req, res) {\n  if (req.method !== ''POST'') {\n    return res.status(405).json({ error: ''Method not allowed'' });\n  }\n\n  // Your logic here\n  res.status(200).json({ success: true });\n}\n```\n\n## Working with MDX Content\n\nUse the lib functions:\n\n```js\nimport { getPostBySlug, getAllPosts } from ''../lib/posts'';\nimport { serialize } from ''next-mdx-remote/serialize'';\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:40.891Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Development Agents specializing in Next.js framework optimization and component generation.","zh":"适合专门从事Next.js框架优化和组件生成的前端开发代理。","ja":"Next.jsフレームワークの最適化とコンポーネント生成を専門とするフロントエンド開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Next.js 프레임워크 최적화 및 컴포넌트 생성을 전문으로 하는 프론트엔드 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo Frontend que se especializan en la optimización del framework Next.js y la generación de componentes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement frontal spécialisés dans l''optimisation du framework Next.js et la génération de composants.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die sich auf die Optimierung des Next.js-Frameworks und die Generierung von Komponenten spezialisieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Frontend especializados em otimização do framework Next.js e geração de componentes.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по разработке frontend, специализирующихся на оптимизации фреймворка Next.js и генерации компонентов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير الأمامي المتخصصين في تحسين إطار Next.js وتوليد المكونات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to rapidly scaffold Next.js projects with standardized conventions, including file-based routing pages, API route structures, and Tailwind CSS integration. Provides MDX content handling capabilities for dynamic documentation and blog implementations.","zh":"使代理能够快速构建Next.js项目，具有标准化的约定，包括基于文件的路由页面、API路由结构和Tailwind CSS集成。提供MDX内容处理功能，用于动态文档和博客实现。","ja":"エージェントがNext.jsプロジェクトを迅速にスケルトン化できるようにし、ファイルベースのルーティングページ、APIルート構造、Tailwind CSS統合などの標準化された規約を含みます。動的なドキュメントとブログの実装のためにMDXコンテンツの処理機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Next.js 프로젝트를 신속하게 스캐폴딩할 수 있도록하며, 파일 기반 라우팅 페이지, API 라우트 구조 및 Tailwind CSS 통합을 포함한 표준화된 규칙을 포함합니다. 동적 문서 및 블로그 구현을 위한 MDX 콘텐츠 처리 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear rápidamente proyectos Next.js con convenciones estandarizadas, incluyendo páginas de enrutamiento basadas en archivos, estructuras de rutas de API y integración con Tailwind CSS. Proporciona capacidades de manejo de contenido MDX para implementaciones de documentación y blogs dinámicos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer rapidement des projets Next.js avec des conventions standardisées, y compris des pages de routage basées sur des fichiers, des structures de routes d''API et une intégration à Tailwind CSS. Fournit des capacités de traitement de contenu MDX pour des implementations de documentation et de blogs dynamiques.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Next.js-Projekte mit standardisierten Konventionen schnell zu erstellen, einschließlich dateibasiertem Routing, API-Route-Strukturen und Tailwind CSS-Integration. Bietet MDX-Inhaltsverarbeitungsfunktionen für dynamische Dokumentations- und Blog-Implementierungen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem rapidamente projetos Next.js com convenções padronizadas, incluindo páginas de roteamento baseadas em arquivos, estruturas de rotas de API e integração com Tailwind CSS. Fornece capacidades de manipulação de conteúdo MDX para documentação dinâmica e implementações de blog.","ru":"Позволяет агентам быстро создавать проекты Next.js с стандартизированными конвенциями, включая страницы маршрутизации на основе файлов, структуры маршрутов API и интеграцию с Tailwind CSS. Предоставляет возможности обработки контента MDX для динамической документации и реализаций блогов.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإنشاء مشاريع Next.js بسرعة مع الاتفاقيات المعيارية، بما في ذلك صفحات التوجيه القائمة على الملفات، وهياكل مسارات API، وتكامل Tailwind CSS. يوفر إمكانيات التعامل مع محتوى MDX للتوثيق الديناميكي وتنفيذ المدونات."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating page components with file-based routing","Creating API route handlers for backend functionality","Styling components with Tailwind CSS utilities","Processing MDX content for documentation pages"],"zh":["使用基于文件的路由生成页面组件","为后端功能创建API路由处理程序","使用Tailwind CSS实用程序样式化组件","处理MDX内容以实现文档页面"],"ja":["ファイルベースのルーティングを使用してページコンポーネントを生成する","バックエンド機能用のAPIルートハンドラーを作成する","Tailwind CSSユーティリティを使用してコンポーネントをスタイリングする","ドキュメントページを実現するためにMDXコンテンツを処理する"],"ko":["파일 기반 라우팅을 사용하여 페이지 컴포넌트를 생성하는 것","백엔드 기능을 위한 API 라우트 핸들러를 생성하는 것","Tailwind CSS 유틸리티를 사용하여 컴포넌트를 스타일링하는 것","문서 페이지를 구현하기 위해 MDX 콘텐츠를 처리하는 것"],"es":["Generación de componentes de página con enrutamiento basado en archivos","Creación de controladores de rutas de API para funcionalidades de backend","Estilado de componentes con utilidades de Tailwind CSS","Procesamiento de contenido MDX para páginas de documentación"],"fr":["Génération de composants de page avec un routage basé sur des fichiers","Création de gestionnaires de routes d''API pour des fonctionnalités de backend","Mise en forme de composants avec des utilitaires de Tailwind CSS","Traitement de contenu MDX pour des pages de documentation"],"de":["Generierung von Seitenelementen mit dateibasiertem Routing","Erstellung von API-Route-Handlern für Backend-Funktionalitäten","Styling von Komponenten mit Tailwind CSS-Utilities","Verarbeitung von MDX-Inhalten für Dokumentationsseiten"],"pt":["Geração de componentes de página com roteamento baseado em arquivos","Criação de manipuladores de rotas de API para funcionalidade de backend","Estilização de componentes com utilitários Tailwind CSS","Processamento de conteúdo MDX para páginas de documentação"],"ru":["Генерация компонентов страниц с маршрутизацией на основе файлов","Создание обработчиков маршрутов API для функциональности бэкэнда","Стилизация компонентов с помощью утилит Tailwind CSS","Обработка контента MDX для страниц документации"],"ar":["توليد مكونات الصفحة مع التوجيه القائم على الملفات","إنشاء معالجات مسارات API للوظائف الخلفية","تنسيق المكونات باستخدام أدوات Tailwind CSS","معالجة محتوى MDX للصفحات الوثائقية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Next.js framework specific","Requires existing project structure","Tailwind CSS dependency"],"zh":["仅适用于Next.js框架","需要现有的项目结构","依赖于Tailwind CSS"],"ja":["Next.jsフレームワーク専用","既存のプロジェクト構造が必要","Tailwind CSSに依存"],"ko":["Next.js 프레임워크 전용","既存의 프로젝트 구조가 필요","Tailwind CSS에 의존"],"es":["Específico del framework Next.js","Requiere una estructura de proyecto existente","Dependencia de Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Spécifique au framework Next.js","Nécessite une structure de projet existante","Dépendance de Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Spezifisch für das Next.js-Framework","Benötigt eine bestehende Projektstruktur","Abhängigkeit von Tailwind CSS"],"pt":["Específico do framework Next.js","Exige estrutura de projeto existente","Dependência de Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["Специфичен для фреймворка Next.js","Требует существующей структуры проекта","Зависимость от Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["محدد لإطار Next.js","يتطلب هيكلا مشروعيا موجودا","اعتماد على Tailwind CSS"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f3db4a35f786a5edcab813c6101f60055880e75df855cc5c0729308351fc016a","qualityScore":54}');
