기능","es":"Un desarrollador frontend crea interfaces de usuario con React, gestiona estados con Zustand y optimiza la experiencia del usuario","fr":"Un développeur frontend crée des interfaces utilisateur avec React, gère les états avec Zustand et optimise l''expérience utilisateur","de":"Ein Frontend-Entwickler erstellt Benutzeroberflächen mit React, verwaltet Zustände mit Zustand und optimiert die Benutzererfahrung","pt":"Frontend developer é um especialista em criar interfaces de usuário com React, Next.js e outras tecnologias de frontend","ru":"Frontend разработчик - это специалист, создающий пользовательские интерфейсы с React, Next.js и другими технологиями frontend для ИИ Агентов","ar":"مطور الواجهة الأمامية هو خبير في إنشاء واجهات المستخدم مع React و Next.js وتقنيات الواجهة الأمامية الأخرى لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Generates React components with Zustand state management","Implements form handling using React Hook Form and Zod","Enables data fetching with TanStack Query","Creates responsive designs using Tailwind CSS","Develops PWA features for enhanced user experience","Handles loading states and skeleton screens for seamless interaction"],"zh":["使用 React 组件构建 UI","实现状态管理（Zustand）","使用 React Hook Form 和 Zod 处理表单","实现数据获取（TanStack Query）","添加加载状态和骨架屏","构建响应式设计（Tailwind CSS）"],"ja":["React コンポーネントを使用して UI を構築","ステート管理（Zustand）を実装","React Hook Form と Zod を使用してフォームを処理","データ取得（TanStack Query）を実装","ローディング状態とスケルトンスクリーンを追加","レスポンシブデザイン（Tailwind CSS）を構築"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트를 사용하여 UI를 구축","상태 관리（Zustand）를 구현","React Hook Form과 Zod를 사용하여 폼을 처리","데이터 가져오기（TanStack Query）를 구현","로딩 상태와 스켈레톤 스크린을 추가","반응형 디자인（Tailwind CSS）을 구축"],"es":["Creación de componentes React","Implementación de Zustand para la gestión de estados","Uso de React Hook Form y Zod para el manejo de formularios","Implementación de TanStack Query para la recuperación de datos","Diseño responsivo con Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Création de composants React","Implémentation de Zustand pour la gestion des états","Utilisation de React Hook Form et Zod pour la gestion des formulaires","Implémentation de TanStack Query pour la récupération de données","Conception réactive avec Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Erstellung von React-Komponenten","Implementierung von Zustand für die Zustandsverwaltung","Verwendung von React Hook Form und Zod für die Formularverarbeitung","Implementierung von TanStack Query für die Datenabfrage","Responsives Design mit Tailwind CSS"],"pt":["Criação de componentes React","Gerenciamento de estado com Zustand","Implementação de formulários com React Hook Form + Zod","Fetch de dados com TanStack Query","Desenvolvimento de design responsivo com Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["Создание компонентов React","Управление состоянием с Zustand","Реализация форм с React Hook Form + Zod","Получение данных с TanStack Query","Разработка адаптивного дизайна с Tailwind CSS для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات React","إدارة الحالة Zustand","تنفيذ الاستمارات مع React Hook Form + Zod","استرجاع البيانات مع TanStack Query","تنمية تصميم مستجيب مع Tailwind CSS لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use frontend-developer","frontend-developer alternative","frontend-developer setup guide","what is frontend-developer","frontend-developer vs React","frontend-developer install","Next.js 16 admin panel tutorial","React component development","Zustand state management"],"zh":["AIエージェント","Frontend Developer","React","Next.js","状态管理","用户体验","UI 库","TanStack Query","Tailwind CSS"],"ja":["AIエージェント","フロントエンド開発者","React","Next.js","ステート管理","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","UI ライブラリ","TanStack Query","Tailwind CSS"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","프론트엔드 개발자","React","Next.js","상태 관리","사용자 경험","UI 라이브러리","TanStack Query","Tailwind CSS"],"es":["desarrollo frontend","Next.js 16","React","Zustand","Tailwind CSS","desarrollo de aplicaciones web","experiencia del usuario","gestión de estados","manejo de formularios"],"fr":["développement frontend","Next.js 16","React","Zustand","Tailwind CSS","développement d''applications web","expérience utilisateur","gestion des états","gestion des formulaires"],"de":["Frontend-Entwicklung","Next.js 16","React","Zustand","Tailwind CSS","Webanwendungsentwicklung","Benutzererfahrung","Zustandsverwaltung","Formularverarbeitung"],"pt":["frontend developer","React","Next.js","Zustand","React Hook Form","Zod","TanStack Query","Tailwind CSS","desenvolvimento web","interfaces de usuário"],"ru":["frontend разработчик","React","Next.js","Zustand","React Hook Form","Zod","TanStack Query","Tailwind CSS","разработка веб-приложений","пользовательские интерфейсы для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["مطور الواجهة الأمامية","React","Next.js","Zustand","React Hook Form","Zod","TanStack Query","Tailwind CSS","تطوير الويب","واجهات المستخدم لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"kafkaspanel1","repo":"panel","repoPath":"kafkaspanel1/panel","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-developer","description":"React components, UI library, state management ve user experience geliştirmek için kullanılır. Zustand, TanStack Query, Tailwind CSS ve accessibility konularında uzman.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Developer Skill\n\nReact components, UI library, state management ve user experience geliştirir.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- React component oluştururken veya düzenlerken\n- State management (Zustand) implementasyonu yaparken\n- Form handling (React Hook Form + Zod) eklerken\n- Data fetching (TanStack Query) implementasyonu yaparken\n- Loading states ve skeleton screens eklerken\n- Empty states ve error boundaries yazarken\n- Responsive design (Tailwind CSS) yaparken\n- PWA features geliştirirken\n- Acc","body":"# Frontend Developer Skill\n\nReact components, UI library, state management ve user experience geliştirir.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- React component oluştururken veya düzenlerken\n- State management (Zustand) implementasyonu yaparken\n- Form handling (React Hook Form + Zod) eklerken\n- Data fetching (TanStack Query) implementasyonu yaparken\n- Loading states ve skeleton screens eklerken\n- Empty states ve error boundaries yazarken\n- Responsive design (Tailwind CSS) yaparken\n- PWA features geliştirirken\n- Accessibility (ARIA) iyileştirmeleri yaparken\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Görevler\n- React component development (ui, shared, features)\n- State management (Zustand stores)\n- Form handling (React Hook Form + Zod)\n- Data fetching (TanStack Query)\n- Loading states ve skeleton screens\n- Empty states ve error boundaries\n- Responsive design (Tailwind CSS)\n- PWA features (manifest, service worker)\n- Accessibility (ARIA labels, keyboard navigation)\n\n### Kurallar\n- Components functional components olmalı\n- TypeScript strict mode kullan\n- Tailwind CSS class names organized (use clsx + tailwind-merge)\n- Component props TypeScript interfaces ile tanımlı\n- No prop drilling (use Zustand or React Context)\n- Error boundaries critical components''lerde\n- Loading states tüm async operations''da\n- Turkish language strings (no hardcoded English)\n\n### Kod Kalitesi\n- Component names PascalCase\n- File names kebab-case (my-component.tsx)\n- Props destructuring\n- useMemo ve useCallback optimization için\n- Consistent naming conventions\n- Reusable components (DRY principle)\n- Accessibility best practices\n\n### Dosya Yapısı\n\n```\nsrc/components/\n├── ui/              # Radix UI components\n│   ├── button.tsx\n│   ├── input.tsx\n│   ├── dialog.tsx\n│   └── ...\n├── shared/          # Shared application components\n│   ├── data-table.tsx\n│   ├── stat-card.tsx\n│   ├── empty-state.tsx\n│   └── ...\n└── features/        # Feature-specific components\n    ├── members/\n    ├── donations/\n    └── social-aid/\n```\n\n### Component Example\n\n```tsx\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\";\n\ninterface StatCardProps {\n  title: string;\n  value: string | number;\n  description?: string;\n  icon?: React.ReactNode;\n  trend?: \"up\" | \"down\" | \"neutral\";\n  className?: string;\n}\n\nexport function StatCard({\n  title,\n  value,\n  description,\n  icon,\n  trend,\n  className,\n}: StatCardProps) {\n  return (\n    <div\n      className={cn(\n        \"rounded-lg border bg-card p-6 shadow-sm\",\n        className\n      )}\n    >\n      <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n        <p className=\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground\">\n          {title}\n        </p>\n        {icon && (\n          <div className=\"text-muted-foreground\">{icon}</div>\n        )}\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"mt-2\">\n        <p className=\"text-2xl font-bold\">{value}</p>\n        {description && (\n          <p className=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1\">\n            {description}\n          </p>\n        )}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### TanStack Query Example\n\n```tsx\nimport { useQuery, useMutation, useQueryClient } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\n\n// Fetch members\nexport function useMembers() {\n  return useQuery({\n    queryKey: [\"members\"],\n    queryFn: async () => {\n      const res = await fetch(\"/api/members\");\n      if (!res.ok) throw new Error(\"Üyeler yüklenemedi\");\n      return res.json();\n    },\n  });\n}\n\n// Create member mutation\nexport function useCreateMember() {\n  const queryClient = useQueryClient();\n  \n  return useMutation({\n    mutationFn: async (data: CreateMemberInput) => {\n      const res = await fetch(\"/api/members\", {\n        method: \"POST\",\n        headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n        body: JSON.stringify(data),\n      });\n      if (!res.ok) throw new Error(\"Üye oluşturulamadı\");\n      return res.json();\n    },\n    onSuccess: () => {\n      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [\"members\"] });\n    },\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Zustand Store Example\n\n```typescript\nimport { create } from \"zustand\";\nimport { persist } from \"zustand/middleware\";\n\ninterface SidebarState {\n  isOpen: boolean;\n  toggle: () => void;\n  setOpen: (open: boolean) => void;\n}\n\nexport const useSidebarStore = create<SidebarState>()(\n  persist(\n    (set) => ({\n      isOpen: true,\n      toggle: () => set((state) => ({ isOpen: !state.isOpen })),\n      setOpen: (open) => set({ isOpen: open }),\n    }),\n    {\n      name: \"sidebar-storage\",\n    }\n  )\n);\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:59.622Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing advanced React component management and UI library integration.","zh":"适合需要高级 React 组件管理和 UI 库集成的 Web 开发代理。","ja":"Web 開発エージェントが高度な React コンポーネント管理と UI ライブラリ統合を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 React 컴포넌트 관리 및 UI 라이브러리 통합이 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan una gestión avanzada de componentes de React y una integración de bibliotecas de interfaz de usuario.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web ayant besoin d''une gestion avancée de composants React et d''une intégration de bibliothèques d''interface utilisateur.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die eine erweiterte React-Komponentenverwaltung und eine Integration von Benutzeroberflächenbibliotheken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que precisam de gerenciamento avançado de componentes React e integração de bibliotecas de interface do usuário.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым необходим продвинутый менеджмент компонентов React и интеграция библиотек интерфейса пользователя.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير الويب الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة متقدمة لمكونات React وتكامل مكتبات واجهة المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage complex React applications with Zustand state management, React Hook Form for form handling, and TanStack Query for data fetching, while also implementing responsive design with Tailwind CSS and PWA features.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理复杂的 React 应用程序的能力，使用 Zustand 状态管理、React Hook Form 进行表单处理和 TanStack Query 进行数据获取，同时还实现了使用 Tailwind CSS 的响应式设计和 PWA 功能。","ja":"Zustand ステート管理、React Hook Form を使用したフォーム処理、TanStack Query を使用したデータ取得を使用して、複雑な React アプリケーションを作成および管理するエージェントの能力を与え、Tailwind CSS を使用したレスポンシブデザインと PWA 機能も実装します。","ko":"Zustand 상태 관리, React Hook Form을 사용한 폼 처리 및 TanStack Query를 사용한 데이터 가져오기를 사용하여 복잡한 React 애플리케이션을 생성 및 관리할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, Tailwind CSS를 사용한 반응형 디자인 및 PWA 기능도 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar aplicaciones React complejas con gestión de estado de Zustand, React Hook Form para el manejo de formularios y TanStack Query para la recuperación de datos, al tiempo que implementa un diseño receptivo con Tailwind CSS y funciones de PWA.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des applications React complexes avec une gestion d''état de Zustand, React Hook Form pour la gestion de formulaires et TanStack Query pour la récupération de données, tout en implémentant une conception réactive avec Tailwind CSS et des fonctionnalités PWA.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe React-Anwendungen mit Zustand-Zustandsverwaltung, React Hook Form für Formularverwaltung und TanStack Query für Datenabruf zu erstellen und zu verwalten, während auch ein responsives Design mit Tailwind CSS und PWA-Funktionen implementiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem e gerenciarem aplicações React complexas com gerenciamento de estado Zustand, React Hook Form para manipulação de formulários e TanStack Query para busca de dados, além de implementar design responsivo com Tailwind CSS e recursos de PWA.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять сложными приложениями React с помощью менеджмента состояния Zustand, React Hook Form для обработки форм и TanStack Query для извлечения данных, а также реализовывать адаптивный дизайн с помощью Tailwind CSS и функций PWA.","ar":"يمنح العملاء khảية إنشاء وتشغيل تطبيقات React المعقدة باستخدام إدارة Zustand للحالة و React Hook Form لمعالجة النماذج و TanStack Query لاسترجاع البيانات، بالإضافة إلى تنفيذ تصميم مستجيب مع Tailwind CSS وميزات PWA."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating and customizing React components for Turkish non-profit organization management systems","Implementing state management solutions using Zustand","Optimizing form handling with React Hook Form and Zod validation","Fetching and managing data with TanStack Query","Designing responsive and mobile-friendly interfaces with Tailwind CSS"],"zh":["为土耳其非营利组织管理系统生成和自定义 React 组件","使用 Zustand 实现状态管理解决方案","使用 React Hook Form 和 Zod 验证优化表单处理","使用 TanStack Query 获取和管理数据","使用 Tailwind CSS 设计响应式和移动友好界面"],"ja":["トルコの非営利組織管理システムの React コンポーネントを生成およびカスタマイズする","Zustand を使用してステート管理ソリューションを実装する","React Hook Form と Zod 検証を使用してフォーム処理を最適化する","TanStack Query を使用してデータを取得および管理する","Tailwind CSS を使用してレスポンシブでモバイルフレンドリーなインターフェースを設計する"],"ko":["터키 비영리조직 관리시스템을 위한 React 컴포넌트 생성 및 사용자정의","Zustand를 사용한 상태 관리 솔루션 구현","React Hook Form 및 Zod 검증을 사용한 폼 처리 최적화","TanStack Query를 사용한 데이터 가져오기 및 관리","Tailwind CSS를 사용한 반응형 및 모바일 친화적 인터페이스 설계"],"es":["Generar y personalizar componentes de React para sistemas de gestión de organizaciones benéficas turcas","Implementar soluciones de gestión de estado utilizando Zustand","Optimizar el manejo de formularios con React Hook Form y validación de Zod","Recuperar y gestionar datos con TanStack Query","Diseñar interfaces receptivas y compatibles con dispositivos móviles con Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Générer et personnaliser des composants React pour les systèmes de gestion d''organisations caritatives turques","Mettre en œuvre des solutions de gestion d''état à l''aide de Zustand","Optimiser la gestion de formulaires avec React Hook Form et validation de Zod","Récupérer et gérer des données avec TanStack Query","Concevoir des interfaces réactives et compatibles avec les appareils mobiles avec Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Erstellen und Anpassen von React-Komponenten für türkische Non-Profit-Organisationsmanagementsysteme","Implementieren von Zustandsverwaltungslösungen mit Zustand","Optimieren der Formularverwaltung mit React Hook Form und Zod-Validierung","Abrufen und Verwalten von Daten mit TanStack Query","Entwerfen von responsiven und mobilfreundlichen Schnittstellen mit Tailwind CSS"],"pt":["Gerar e personalizar componentes React para sistemas de gerenciamento de organizações não lucrativas turcas","Implementar soluções de gerenciamento de estado usando Zustand","Otimizar manipulação de formulários com React Hook Form e validação Zod","Buscar e gerenciar dados com TanStack Query","Projetar interfaces responsivas e amigáveis para dispositivos móveis com Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["Генерировать и настраивать компоненты React для систем управления турецкими некоммерческими организациями","Реализовывать решения для менеджмента состояния с помощью Zustand","Оптимизировать обработку форм с помощью React Hook Form и валидации Zod","Извлекать и управлять данными с помощью TanStack Query","Разрабатывать адаптивные и мобильные интерфейсы с помощью Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["генерировать و تخصيص مكونات React لنظم إدارة المنظمات غير الهادفة للربح التركية","تنفيذ حلول لإدارة الحالة باستخدام Zustand","تحسين معالجة النماذج باستخدام React Hook Form و التحقق من Zod","استرجاع و إدارة البيانات باستخدام TanStack Query","تصميم واجهات مستجيبة و友لية للمobil مع Tailwind CSS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React and JavaScript expertise","Limited to frontend development tasks","Dependent on specific libraries and frameworks (e.g., React, Zustand, React Hook Form, TanStack Query, Tailwind CSS)"],"zh":["需要 React 和 JavaScript 专长","仅限前端开发任务","依赖特定的库和框架（例如 React、Zustand、React Hook Form、TanStack Query、Tailwind CSS）"],"ja":["React と JavaScript の専門知識が必要","フロントエンド開発タスクのみ","特定のライブラリとフレームワーク（例：React、Zustand、React Hook Form、TanStack Query、Tailwind CSS）に依存"],"ko":["React 및 JavaScript 전문 지식이 필요합니다","프론트엔드 개발 작업만 해당","특정 라이브러리 및 프레임워크(예: React, Zustand, React Hook Form, TanStack Query, Tailwind CSS)에 의존"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en React y JavaScript","Limitado a tareas de desarrollo frontend","Dependiente de bibliotecas y frameworks específicos (por ejemplo, React, Zustand, React Hook Form, TanStack Query, Tailwind CSS)"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en React et JavaScript","Limité aux tâches de développement frontend","Dépendant de bibliothèques et de frameworks spécifiques (par exemple, React, Zustand, React Hook Form, TanStack Query, Tailwind CSS)"],"de":["Erfordert Expertenwissen in React und JavaScript","Begrenzt auf Frontend-Entwicklungsaufgaben","Abhängig von bestimmten Bibliotheken und Frameworks (z. B. React, Zustand, React Hook Form, TanStack Query, Tailwind CSS)"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento em React e JavaScript","Limitado a tarefas de desenvolvimento frontend","Dependente de bibliotecas e frameworks específicas (por exemplo, React, Zustand, React Hook Form, TanStack Query, Tailwind CSS)"],"ru":["Требует знаний React и JavaScript","Ограничен задачами frontend-разработки","Зависит от конкретных библиотек и фреймворков (например, React, Zustand, React Hook Form, TanStack Query, Tailwind CSS)"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة ب React و JavaScript","محدود بمهمات تطوير واجهة المستخدم","يعتمد على مكتبات وأطر عمل محددة (على سبيل المثال، React، Zustand، React Hook Form، TanStack Query، Tailwind CSS)"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"d04c29c9a25851b33c9b9a2691843278b9d78a6a73dac35c06afd628ef6c0d2b","qualityScore":54}');
