PI professionnels en quelques minutes","Intégration avec des outils d''automatisation tels que Stripe et ShipStation","Prise en charge de la création de récepteurs de webhooks","Configuration de scripts d''exécution pour l''automatisation de tâches"],"de":["Erstellung von Pydantic-Modellen für die Datavalidierung","Konfiguration von FastAPI-Projekten für die Erstellung von API-Endpunkten","Erstellung von professionellen API-Endpunkten in Minuten","Integration mit Automatisierungstools wie Stripe und ShipStation","Unterstützung für die Erstellung von Webhook-Empfängern","Konfiguration von Ausführungsskripten für die Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Criação de endpoints de API profissionais em minutos","Suporte a modelos Pydantic para definição de esquemas de dados","Integração com projetos FastAPI","Possibilidade de adicionar endpoints a scripts de execução existentes","Suporte a webhooks de serviços como Stripe e ShipStation"],"ru":["Создание профессиональных REST API за минуты","Поддержка моделей Pydantic для определения схем данных","Интеграция с проектами FastAPI","Возможность добавления ендпоинтов к существующим скриптам выполнения","Поддержка вебхуков сервисов như Stripe и ShipStation"],"ar":["إنشاء نقاط نهاية API محترفة في دقائق","دعم نماذج Pydantic لتحديد مخططات البيانات","التكامل مع مشاريع FastAPI","إمكانية إضافة نقاط نهاية إلى سكريبتات تنفيذ موجودة","دعم الويب هوك لخدمات مثل Stripe و ShipStation"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use api-scaffolding","api-scaffolding setup guide","FastAPI project setup","api-scaffolding vs Flask","what is api-scaffolding","api-scaffolding install","api-scaffolding tutorial","api-scaffolding alternative","api-scaffolding documentation"],"zh":["api-scaffolding","REST API","SMB自动化","客户交付","Pydantic Models","FastAPI","execution/脚本","AIエージェント"],"ja":["api-scaffolding","REST API","SMB自動化","クライアント納品","Pydantic Models","FastAPI","execution/スクリプト","AIエージェント"],"ko":["api-scaffolding","REST API","SMB 자동화","클라이언트 전달","Pydantic Models","FastAPI","execution/스크립트","AI 도구"],"es":["API Scaffolding","Automatización de SMB","Creación de endpoints de API","Modelos Pydantic","FastAPI","Webhooks","Stripe","ShipStation","Automatización de tareas","Desarrollo de API"],"fr":["API Scaffolding","Automatisation des PME","Création d''endpoints d''API","Modèles Pydantic","FastAPI","Webhooks","Stripe","ShipStation","Automatisation de tâches","Développement d''API"],"de":["API-Scaffolding","Automatisierung von SMB","Erstellung von API-Endpunkten","Pydantic-Modelle","FastAPI","Webhooks","Stripe","ShipStation","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","API-Entwicklung"],"pt":["API Scaffolding","Automação de SMB","FastAPI","Pydantic","Endpoints de API","Webhooks","Stripe","ShipStation","Desenvolvimento de API"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","API Scaffolding","Автоматизация бизнес-процессов","FastAPI","Pydantic","REST API","Вебхуки","Stripe","ShipStation","Разработка API"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","API Scaffolding","آليّة أتمتة الأعمال","FastAPI","Pydantic","نقاط نهاية API","الويب هوك","Stripe","ShipStation","تطوير API"]}},"owner":"simplysmartai","repo":"5cypressautomation","repoPath":"simplysmartai/5cypressautomation","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.500Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api-scaffolding","description":"Quickly scaffold production-ready FastAPI endpoints for client workflows. Use when building new APIs for QuickBooks, ShipStation, or webhook integrations.","bodyPreview":"# API Scaffolding for SMB Automation\n\nSpin up professional REST APIs in minutes for client deliverables.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating new API endpoints for client workflows\n- Building webhook receivers (Stripe, ShipStation, etc.)\n- Setting up FastAPI projects from scratch\n- Adding endpoints to existing `execution/` scripts\n\n## Quick Start: New Endpoint\n\n### 1. Define the Pydantic Models\n```python\n# execution/schemas/invoice.py\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel, EmailStr, Field\nfrom typing","body":"# API Scaffolding for SMB Automation\n\nSpin up professional REST APIs in minutes for client deliverables.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating new API endpoints for client workflows\n- Building webhook receivers (Stripe, ShipStation, etc.)\n- Setting up FastAPI projects from scratch\n- Adding endpoints to existing `execution/` scripts\n\n## Quick Start: New Endpoint\n\n### 1. Define the Pydantic Models\n```python\n# execution/schemas/invoice.py\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel, EmailStr, Field\nfrom typing import Optional\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\nclass LineItem(BaseModel):\n    description: str\n    quantity: int = Field(gt=0)\n    unit_price: float = Field(gt=0)\n\nclass CreateInvoiceRequest(BaseModel):\n    customer_email: EmailStr\n    customer_name: str = Field(min_length=1, max_length=100)\n    line_items: list[LineItem] = Field(min_length=1)\n    due_date: datetime\n    memo: Optional[str] = None\n\nclass InvoiceResponse(BaseModel):\n    invoice_id: str\n    qbo_id: Optional[str] = None\n    status: str\n    total: float\n    created_at: datetime\n```\n\n### 2. Create the Endpoint\n```python\n# execution/api/invoices.py\nfrom fastapi import APIRouter, HTTPException, Depends\nfrom ..schemas.invoice import CreateInvoiceRequest, InvoiceResponse\nfrom ..services.qbo_service import qbo_service\nimport logging\n\nrouter = APIRouter(prefix=\"/invoices\", tags=[\"invoices\"])\nlog = logging.getLogger(__name__)\n\n@router.post(\"/\", response_model=InvoiceResponse, status_code=201)\nasync def create_invoice(request: CreateInvoiceRequest):\n    \"\"\"Create a new invoice in QuickBooks.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        # Calculate total\n        total = sum(item.quantity * item.unit_price for item in request.line_items)\n\n        # Create in QBO\n        qbo_invoice = await qbo_service.create_invoice(\n            customer_email=request.customer_email,\n            customer_name=request.customer_name,\n            line_items=[item.model_dump() for item in request.line_items],\n            due_date=request.due_date,\n            memo=request.memo\n        )\n\n        log.info(\"Invoice created\", extra={\n            \"invoice_id\": qbo_invoice.id,\n            \"customer\": request.customer_email,\n            \"total\": total\n        })\n\n        return InvoiceResponse(\n            invoice_id=qbo_invoice.doc_number,\n            qbo_id=qbo_invoice.id,\n            status=\"created\",\n            total=total,\n            created_at=datetime.utcnow()\n        )\n\n    except QBOAuthError:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=401, detail=\"QuickBooks auth expired\")\n    except QBOValidationError as e:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=422, detail=str(e))\n    except Exception as e:\n        log.exception(\"Invoice creation failed\")\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=500, detail=\"Internal error\")\n```\n\n### 3. Wire Up the Router\n```python\n# execution/main.py\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\nfrom .api import invoices, webhooks, inventory\n\napp = FastAPI(\n    title=\"SMB Automation API\",\n    version=\"1.0.0\"\n)\n\napp.include_router(invoices.router, prefix=\"/api/v1\")\napp.include_router(webhooks.router, prefix=\"/api/v1\")\napp.include_router(inventory.router, prefix=\"/api/v1\")\n\n@app.get(\"/health\")\nasync def health():\n    return {\"status\": \"ok\"}\n```\n\n## Common Endpoint Patterns\n\n### Webhook Receiver\n```python\n# execution/api/webhooks.py\nfrom fastapi import APIRouter, Request, HTTPException, Header\nimport hmac\nimport hashlib\n\nrouter = APIRouter(prefix=\"/webhooks\", tags=[\"webhooks\"])\n\n@router.post(\"/stripe\")\nasync def stripe_webhook(\n    request: Request,\n    stripe_signature: str = Header(alias=\"Stripe-Signature\")\n):\n    \"\"\"Handle Stripe webhook events.\"\"\"\n    payload = await request.body()\n\n    # Verify signature\n    try:\n        event = stripe.Webhook.construct_event(\n            payload, stripe_signature, WEBHOOK_SECRET\n        )\n    except stripe.error.SignatureVerificationError:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=400, detail=\"Invalid signature\")\n\n    # Process idempotently\n    event_id = event[\"id\"]\n    if await is_processed(event_id):\n        return {\"status\": \"duplicate\"}\n\n    # Handle event types\n    match event[\"type\"]:\n        case \"payment_intent.succeeded\":\n            await handle_payment_success(event[\"data\"][\"object\"])\n        case \"invoice.paid\":\n            await handle_invoice_paid(event[\"data\"][\"object\"])\n\n    await mark_processed(event_id)\n    return {\"status\": \"processed\"}\n```\n\n### CRUD Resource\n```python\n# execution/api/customers.py\nfrom fastapi import APIRouter, HTTPException, Query\nfrom typing import Optional\n\nrouter = APIRouter(prefix=\"/customers\", tags=[\"customers\"])\n\n@router.get(\"/\")\nasync def list_customers(\n    skip: int = Query(0, ge=0),\n    limit: int = Query(50, ge=1, le=100),\n    status: Optional[str] = None\n):\n    \"\"\"List customers with pagination.\"\"\"\n    customers = await customer_service.list(skip=skip, limit=limit, status=status)\n    return {\"customers\": customers, \"total\": len(customers)}\n\n@router.get(\"/{customer_id}\")\nasync def get_customer(customer_id: str):\n    \"\"\"Get customer by ID.\"\"\"\n    customer = await customer_service.get(customer_id)\n    if not customer:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"Customer not found\")\n    return customer\n\n@router.post(\"/\", status_code=201)\nasync def create_customer(request: CreateCustomerRequest):\n    \"\"\"Create new customer.\"\"\"\n    customer = await customer_service.create(request)\n    return customer\n\n@router.patch(\"/{customer_id}\")\nasync def update_customer(customer_id: str, request: UpdateCustomerRequest):\n    \"\"\"Update customer.\"\"\"\n    customer = await customer_service.update(customer_id, request)\n    if not customer:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"Customer not found\")\n    return customer\n\n@router.delete(\"/{customer_id}\", status_code=204)\nasync def delete_customer(customer_id: str):\n    \"\"\"Delete customer.\"\"\"\n    deleted = await customer_service.delete(customer_id)\n    if not deleted:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"Customer not found\")\n```\n\n### Background Task Trigger\n```python\n# execution/api/jobs.py\nfrom fastapi import APIRouter, BackgroundTasks\n\nrouter = APIRouter(prefix=\"/jobs\", tags=[\"jobs\"])\n\n@router.post(\"/sync-inventory\")\nasync def trigger_inventory_sync(background_tasks: BackgroundTasks):\n    \"\"\"Trigger background inventory sync.\"\"\"\n    job_id = generate_job_id()\n\n    background_tasks.add_task(sync_inventory_task, job_id)\n\n    return {\n        \"job_id\": job_id,\n        \"status\": \"queued\",\n        \"check_status\": f\"/api/v1/jobs/{job_id}\"\n    }\n\n@router.get(\"/{job_id}\")\nasync def get_job_status(job_id: str):\n    \"\"\"Check job status.\"\"\"\n    job = await job_store.get(job_id)\n    if not job:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"Job not found\")\n    return job\n```\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nexecution/\n├── main.py                 # FastAPI app entry\n├── api/\n│   ├── __init__.py\n│   ├── invoices.py         # Invoice endpoints\n│   ├── webhooks.py         # Webhook receivers\n│   ├── customers.py        # Customer CRUD\n│   └── jobs.py             # Background job triggers\n├── schemas/\n│   ├── __init__.py\n│   ├── invoice.py          # Invoice Pydantic models\n│   └── customer.py         # Customer Pydantic models\n├── services/\n│   ├── __init__.py\n│   ├── qbo_service.py      # QuickBooks API client\n│   └── stripe_service.py   # Stripe API client\n└── core/\n    ├── config.py           # Settings from .env\n    ├── database.py         # DB connection (if needed)\n    └── security.py         # Auth helpers\n```\n\n## Essential Dependencies\n\n```txt\n# requirements.txt\nfastapi>=0.109.0\nuvicorn>=0.27.0\npydantic>=2.5.0\npydantic-settings>=2.1.0\nhttpx>=0.26.0\npython-dotenv>=1.0.0\n```\n\n## Running Locally\n\n```bash\n# Install\npip install -r requirements.txt\n\n# Run\nuvicorn execution.main:app --reload --port 8000\n\n# Docs\nopen http://localhost:8000/docs\n```\n\n## Deployment Checklist\n\n- [ ] All endpoints have Pydantic request/response models\n- [ ] Error handling returns proper status codes\n- [ ] Logging includes context (IDs, user info)\n- [ ] Secrets in `.env`, not hardcoded\n- [ ] Health endpoint at `/health`\n- [ ] CORS configured if needed\n- [ ] Rate limiting for public endpoints\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:16.892Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for FastAPI Agents needing rapid REST API scaffolding and webhook integration.","zh":"适合需要快速REST API脚手架和Webhook集成的FastAPI代理。","ja":"FastAPIエージェントが急速にREST APIのスケルトンとWebhookの統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"빠른 REST API 스캐폴딩 및 웹후크 통합이 필요한 FastAPI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de FastAPI que necesitan una estructura de API REST rápida y una integración de webhook.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents FastAPI nécessitant un squelette d''API REST rapide et une intégration de webhook.","de":"Perfekt für FastAPI-Agents, die eine schnelle REST-API-Struktur und eine Webhook-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes FastAPI que necessitam de estruturação rápida de REST API e integração de webhook.","ru":"Идеально для агентов FastAPI, которым требуется быстрая сборка REST API и интеграция вебхука.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء FastAPI الذين يحتاجون إلى هيكلة سريعة لREST API وتكامل الويب هوك."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate professional REST APIs quickly using Pydantic models and FastAPI, supporting webhook receivers like Stripe and ShipStation, and streamlining workflow automation.","zh":"赋予代理快速使用Pydantic模型和FastAPI生成专业的REST API的能力，支持Stripe和ShipStation等Webhook接收器，并简化工作流自动化。","ja":"PydanticモデルとFastAPIを使用して、エージェントがプロフェッショナルなREST APIを迅速に生成できるようにし、StripeやShipStationなどのWebhook受信機をサポートし、ワークフローの自動化を簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 Pydantic 모델 및 FastAPI를 사용하여 전문가적인 REST API를 빠르게 생성 할 수 있도록 하며, Stripe 및 ShipStationなどの 웹후크 수신기를 지원하고 워크플로 자동화를 간소화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar API REST profesionales rápidamente utilizando modelos Pydantic y FastAPI, y admitiendo receptores de webhooks como Stripe y ShipStation, y mejorando la automatización de flujos de trabajo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer rapidement des API REST professionnelles en utilisant des modèles Pydantic et FastAPI, et en prenant en charge les récepteurs de webhooks tels que Stripe et ShipStation, et en rationalisant l''automatisation des flux de travail.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, professionelle REST-APIs schnell mit Pydantic-Modellen und FastAPI zu erstellen, und unterstützt Webhook-Empfänger wie Stripe und ShipStation, und rationalisiert die Automatisierung von Workflows.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar APIs REST profissionais rapidamente usando modelos Pydantic e FastAPI, suportando receptores de webhook como Stripe e ShipStation, e otimizando a automação de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Позволяет агентам быстро создавать профессиональные REST API, используя модели Pydantic и FastAPI, поддерживая получатели вебхука, такие как Stripe и ShipStation, и оптимизируя автоматизацию рабочих процессов.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء APIs REST احترافية بسرعة باستخدام نماذج Pydantic و FastAPI، ودعم مستقبلات الويب هوك مثل Stripe و ShipStation، وتبسيط автомة سير العمل."},"useCases":{"en":["Building new API endpoints for client workflows","Setting up webhook receivers for services like Stripe","Automating workflow tasks with custom FastAPI projects"],"zh":["为客户工作流构建新的API端点","为Stripe等服务设置Webhook接收器","使用自定义FastAPI项目自动执行工作流任务"],"ja":["クライアントのワークフロー用に新しいAPIエンドポイントを構築する","Stripeなどのサービス用にWebhook受信機を設定する","カスタムFastAPIプロジェクトを使用してワークフローのタスクを自動化する"],"ko":["클라이언트 워크플로우를 위한 새로운 API 엔드포인트 구축","스트라이프 등의 서비스를 위한 웹후크 수신기 설정","사용자 지정 FastAPI 프로젝트를 사용하여 워크플로우 작업 자동화"],"es":["Creación de nuevos puntos finales de API para flujos de trabajo de clientes","Configuración de receptores de webhooks para servicios como Stripe","Automatización de tareas de flujo de trabajo con proyectos personalizados de FastAPI"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux points de terminaison d''API pour les flux de travail des clients","Configuration des récepteurs de webhooks pour des services comme Stripe","Automatisation des tâches de flux de travail avec des projets FastAPI personnalisés"],"de":["Erstellung neuer API-Endpunkte für Client-Workflows","Einrichtung von Webhook-Empfängern für Dienste wie Stripe","Automatisierung von Workflow-Aufgaben mit benutzerdefinierten FastAPI-Projekten"],"pt":["Construir novos pontos de extremidade de API para fluxos de trabalho do cliente","Configurar receptores de webhook para serviços como Stripe","Automatizar tarefas de fluxo de trabalho com projetos FastAPI personalizados"],"ru":["Создание новых конечных точек API для рабочих процессов клиентов","Настройка получателей вебхука для сервисов, таких как Stripe","Автоматизация задач рабочего процесса с помощью пользовательских проектов FastAPI"],"ar":["بناء نقاط نهاية API جديدة لتدفقات العمل العميل","تكوين مستقبلات الويب هوك لخدمات مثل Stripe","توفير مهام سير العمل باستخدام مشاريع FastAPI مخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","FastAPI and Pydantic dependencies","Limited to REST API and webhook use cases"],"zh":["需要Python环境","FastAPI和Pydantic的依赖","仅限REST API和Webhook的使用场景"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","FastAPIとPydanticの依存関係","REST APIとWebhookの使用例のみ"],"ko":["파이썬 환경 필요","FastAPI 및 Pydantic 종속성","REST API 및 웹후크 사용 사례에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Dependencias de FastAPI y Pydantic","Limitado a casos de uso de API REST y webhook"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Dépendances de FastAPI et Pydantic","Limité aux cas d''utilisation d''API REST et de webhook"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","FastAPI- und Pydantic-Abhängigkeiten","Begrenzt auf REST-API- und Webhook-Anwendungsfälle"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Dependências FastAPI e Pydantic","Limitado a casos de uso de REST API e webhook"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Зависимости FastAPI и Pydantic","Ограничен до случаев использования REST API и вебхука"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","اعتمادات FastAPI و Pydantic","محدود لحالات استخدام REST API و الويب هوك"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"0ef8f764eea3dc3a2f7341f34961f1332cbb76f48107a64278c525d37fa341fa","qualityScore":54}');
