:["Verarbeitung von Multimediainhalten mit der Gemini 3 API","Installation mit pip","Konfiguration des API-Schlüssels über .env-Dateien","Kompatibilität mit Google GenAI und Pillow","Automatisches Laden des API-Schlüssels aus .env-Dateien"],"pt":["Interface unificada para processar e gerar conteúdo multimodal","Integração com Gemini 3 API","Utilização de bibliotecas como Google GenAI e Pillow","Configuração de chave API via arquivo .env","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Унифицированный интерфейс для обработки и генерации мультимодального контента","Интеграция с Gemini 3 API","Использование библиотек Google GenAI и Pillow","Настройка ключа API через файл .env","Поддержка нескольких сред разработки"],"ar":["واجهة موحدة لمعالجة وتوليد المحتوى المتعدد","التكامل مع Gemini 3 API","استخدام مكتبات مثل Google GenAI و Pillow","تحديد مفتاح API عبر ملف .env","دعم بيئات متعددة للتنمية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use multimodal-io","multimodal-io setup guide","Gemini 3 API integration","multimodal content processing","multimodal-io alternative","multimodal-io install","what is multimodal-io","multimodal-io vs other AI agent skills","multimodal-io for AI agents"],"zh":["Multimodal I/O","Gemini 3 API","多模态内容处理","环境变量配置","AI工具","google-genai","pillow","pip安装"],"ja":["Multimodal I/O","Gemini 3 API","マルチモーダルコンテンツ処理","環境変数の設定","AIエージェント","google-genai","pillow","pipインストール"],"ko":["멀티모달 I/O","Gemini 3 API","멀티모달 콘텐츠 처리","환경 변수 설정","AI 도구","google-genai","pillow","pip 설치"],"es":["Multimodal I/O","Gemini 3 API","procesamiento de contenido multimodal","instalación con pip","configuración de la clave de API","Google GenAI","Pillow","desarrollo de AI","herramientas de AI"],"fr":["Multimodal I/O","API Gemini 3","traitement de contenu multimodal","installation avec pip","configuration de la clé d''API","Google GenAI","Pillow","développement d''IA","outils d''IA"],"de":["Multimodal I/O","Gemini 3 API","Verarbeitung von Multimediainhalten","Installation mit pip","Konfiguration des API-Schlüssels","Google GenAI","Pillow","Entwicklung von KI","KI-Tools"],"pt":["Multimodal-io","Gemini 3 API","Google GenAI","Pillow","processamento de conteúdo multimodal","geração de conteúdo multimodal","interface unificada","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Multimodal-io","Gemini 3 API","Google GenAI","Pillow","обработка мультимодального контента","генерация мультимодального контента","унифицированный интерфейс","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["Multimodal-io","Gemini 3 API","Google GenAI","Pillow","معالجة المحتوى المتعدد","توليد المحتوى المتعدد","واجهة موحدة","تنمية البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Trongdepzai-dev","repo":"Xorium-Stealer-Pulsar","repoPath":"Trongdepzai-dev/Xorium-Stealer-Pulsar","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.571Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"multimodal-io","description":"Unified multimodal I/O with Gemini 3. Handle text/image/audio/video inputs, generate images (Imagen/Gemini), videos (Veo). Supports media resolution control, thinking levels, streaming.","bodyPreview":"# Multimodal I/O\n\nUnified interface for processing and generating multimodal content via Gemini 3 API.\n\n## Setup\n\n```bash\npip install google-genai pillow\n```\n\n### API Key Configuration\n\nThe script auto-loads `GEMINI_API_KEY` from `.env` files in priority order:\n\n1. **Skill dir**: `.gemini/extensions/multimodal-io/.env` (highest)\n2. **Project root**: `.env` (searches up to git root)\n3. **User home**: `~/.gemini/.env`, `~/.gemini.env`, `~/.env`\n\nEnvironment variables set directly (`export GEMINI_A","body":"# Multimodal I/O\n\nUnified interface for processing and generating multimodal content via Gemini 3 API.\n\n## Setup\n\n```bash\npip install google-genai pillow\n```\n\n### API Key Configuration\n\nThe script auto-loads `GEMINI_API_KEY` from `.env` files in priority order:\n\n1. **Skill dir**: `.gemini/extensions/multimodal-io/.env` (highest)\n2. **Project root**: `.env` (searches up to git root)\n3. **User home**: `~/.gemini/.env`, `~/.gemini.env`, `~/.env`\n\nEnvironment variables set directly (`export GEMINI_API_KEY=...`) take precedence over all `.env` files.\n\n## CLI Usage\n\n```bash\n# Process any media\npython scripts/mmio.py process <file> --prompt \"describe this\"\n\n# Generate image\npython scripts/mmio.py imagine \"sunset over mountains\" --ratio 16:9\n\n# Generate video\npython scripts/mmio.py video \"waves on beach\" --duration 8\n\n# Transcribe audio/video\npython scripts/mmio.py transcribe <file> --timestamps\n\n# Convert document to markdown\npython scripts/mmio.py convert <pdf|docx> --output result.md\n```\n\n## Python API\n\n```python\nfrom mmio import MMIO\n\nmm = MMIO()\n\n# Analyze any media\nresult = mm.process(\"photo.jpg\", \"what objects are visible?\")\n\n# Generate image\nimg = mm.imagine(\"cyberpunk city\", ratio=\"16:9\", size=\"2K\")\n\n# Generate video\nvid = mm.video(\"flying through clouds\", resolution=\"1080p\")\n\n# Transcribe with timestamps\ntext = mm.transcribe(\"meeting.mp3\", timestamps=True)\n```\n\n## Models\n\n| Task | Default | Alternatives |\n|------|---------|--------------|\n| Analysis | gemini-3-flash-preview | gemini-3-pro-preview |\n| Image Gen | gemini-2.5-flash-image | imagen-4.0-*, gemini-3-pro-preview-image |\n| Video Gen | veo-3.1-generate-preview | veo-3.1-fast-* |\n| Transcription | gemini-3-flash-preview | gemini-3-pro-preview |\n\n## Key Features\n\n- **Media Resolution**: Control quality/token tradeoff (`low`/`medium`/`high`)\n- **Thinking Levels**: Adjust reasoning depth (`minimal`/`low`/`high`)\n- **Streaming**: Real-time output for long operations\n- **Auto-chunking**: Handles large files automatically\n\n## References\n\n| Topic | File |\n|-------|------|\n| Input Processing | `references/inputs.md` |\n| Image Generation | `references/image-gen.md` |\n| Video Generation | `references/video-gen.md` |\n| Streaming & Live | `references/streaming.md` |\n\n## Limits\n\n- Inline: 20MB | File API: 2GB\n- Audio: 9.5h max | Video: 1h max\n- Image gen: 4 per request | Video: 8s duration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:45.641Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing unified multimodal content processing and generation via the Gemini 3 API.","zh":"适用于需要通过Gemini 3 API实现统一的多模态内容处理和生成的AI代理。","ja":"Gemini 3 APIを介して統一された多モーダルコンテンツの処理および生成を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Gemini 3 API를 통해 통합 멀티모달 콘텐츠 처리 및 생성이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan procesamiento y generación de contenido multimodal unificado a través de la API Gemini 3.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant un traitement et une génération de contenu multimodal unifiés via l''API Gemini 3.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die ein einheitliches multimodales Inhaltsverarbeitungs- und -erstellungsverfahren über die Gemini-3-API benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de processamento e geração de conteúdo multimodal unificado via API Gemini 3.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется объединенный многомодальный контент-процессинг и генерация через API Gemini 3.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى معالجة ومعالجة محتوى متعدد الوسائط موحد عبر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Gemini 3."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to process and generate multimodal content using the Gemini 3 API, leveraging libraries like google-genai and pillow for comprehensive multimedia data analysis and creation, supporting various file formats and protocols.","zh":"赋予代理使用Gemini 3 API处理和生成多模态内容的能力，利用像google-genai和pillow这样的库进行全面性的多媒体数据分析和创建，支持多种文件格式和协议。","ja":"Gemini 3 APIを使用して多モーダルコンテンツを処理および生成するエージェントの能力を提供し、google-genaiやpillowなどのライブラリを利用して包括的なマルチメディアデータ分析および作成を実現し、様々なファイル形式やプロトコルをサポートします。","ko":"Gemini 3 API를 사용하여 멀티모달 콘텐츠를 처리하고 생성하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, google-genai 및 pillow와 같은 라이브러리를 활용하여 포괄적인 멀티미디어 데이터 분석 및 생성을 실현하며, 다양한 파일 형식 및 프로토콜을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a procesar y generar contenido multimodal utilizando la API Gemini 3, aprovechando bibliotecas como google-genai y pillow para un análisis y creación de datos multimedia exhaustivos, y soportando varios formatos de archivos y protocolos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traiter et de générer du contenu multimodal en utilisant l''API Gemini 3, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme google-genai et pillow pour une analyse et une création de données multimédia complètes, et en prenant en charge divers formats de fichiers et protocoles.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, multimodales Inhaltsverarbeitungs- und Erstellungsverfahren über die Gemini-3-API durchzuführen, indem Bibliotheken wie google-genai und pillow für eine umfassende Analyse und Erstellung von Multimediadaten genutzt werden und verschiedene Dateiformate und Protokolle unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a processar e gerar conteúdo multimodal usando a API Gemini 3, aproveitando bibliotecas como google-genai e pillow para análise e criação abrangentes de dados multimídia, suportando vários formatos de arquivo e protocolos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать и генерировать многомодальный контент с помощью API Gemini 3, используя библиотеки như google-genai и pillow для комплексного анализа и создания мультимедиа-данных, поддерживая различные форматы файлов и протоколы.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على معالجة وإنشاء محتوى متعدد الوسائط باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Gemini 3، مستفيداً من مكتبات مثل google-genai و pillow لتحليل وإنشاء بيانات الوسائط المتعددة الشاملة، ودعم تنسيقات الملفات والبروتوكولات المختلفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating multimodal data processing for AI model training","Generating multimedia content for interactive applications","Debugging multimodal input/output streams for improved agent performance"],"zh":["自动化AI模型训练的多模态数据处理","为交互式应用程序生成多媒体内容","调试多模态输入/输出流以提高代理性能"],"ja":["AIモデル学習のための多モーダルデータ処理の自動化","インタラクティブアプリケーション向けのマルチメディアコンテンツの生成","エージェントのパフォーマンスの向上のための多モーダル入出力ストリームのデバッグ"],"ko":["AI 모델 훈련을 위한 멀티모달 데이터 처리 자동화","인터랙티브 애플리케