ompatible avec l''interface utilisateur de Lore","de":"Der json-formatter ist eine Fähigkeit, die die JSON-Ausgabe formatiert, um sie mit der Lore-Benutzeroberfläche kompatibel zu machen","pt":"O json-formatter é uma habilidade que fornece formatação de saída JSON válida e consistente","ru":"Json-formatter - навык, который обеспечивает валидное и последовательное форматирование JSON-выхода","ar":"json-formatter هي مهارة توفر تنسيق إخراج JSON صحيح ومستمر"},"features":{"en":["Generates valid JSON with no trailing commas or comments","Uses the GUI export format defined in src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py","Supports plural collections with top-level keys and array values","Loads JSON data into the Lore GUI using LoreData.from_dict","Follows a defined export schema for consistent data formatting","Produces parseable JSON for seamless integration with other tools"],"zh":["支持有效的 JSON 输出","遵循 GUI 导出格式","支持复数集合","顶级键值对应复数名称","数组值输出"],"ja":["有効な JSON 出力をサポート","GUI エクスポート形式に準拠","複数コレクションをサポート","トップレベルキーは複数名詞","配列値出力"],"ko":["유효한 JSON 출력을 지원","GUI 내보내기 형식에 따라","복수 컬렉션을 지원","최상위 키는 복수 이름","배열 값 출력"],"es":["Produce JSON válido sin comas finales ni comentarios","Utiliza el formato de esquema de exportación definido en src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py","Crea colecciones de entidades con nombres plurales y valores de matriz","Es compatible con la interfaz de usuario de Lore"],"fr":["Produit du JSON valide sans virgules finales ni commentaires","Utilise le format de schéma d''exportation défini dans src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py","Crée des collections d''entités avec des noms pluriels et des valeurs de tableau","Est compatible avec l''interface utilisateur de Lore"],"de":["Erzeugt gültiges JSON ohne abschließende Kommas oder Kommentare","Verwendet das im src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py definierte Export-Schema-Format","Erstellt Entitäten-Sammlungen mit pluralen Namen und Array-Werten","Ist kompatibel mit der Lore-Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["Saída JSON válida e sem erros","Uso do esquema de exportação definido em src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py","Coleções de entidades com nomes plurais e valores de matriz","Compatibilidade com o Lore GUI"],"ru":["Валидный и безошибочный JSON-выход","Использование схемы экспорта, определенной в src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py","Коллекции сущностей с множественными именами и массивными значениями","Совместимость с Lore GUI"],"ar":["إخراج JSON صحيح وبدون أخطاء","استخدام مخطط التصدير المحدد في src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py","مجموعات الكينونات مع أسماء جمعية وقيم مصفوفة","التوافق مع واجهة المستخدم Lore"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use json-formatter","json-formatter setup guide","json-formatter alternative","json-formatter vs other formatters","what is json-formatter","json-formatter install","json-formatter for AI agents","json output formatting","valid JSON generation","Lore GUI data loading"],"zh":["JSON 格式化工具","世界构建软件","JSON 输出格式化","有效的 JSON 输出","GUI 导出格式","复数集合","AI 工具","AI 에이전트"],"ja":["JSON フォーマッター","ワールドビルディングソフトウェア","JSON 出力形式","有効な JSON 出力","GUI エクスポート形式","複数コレクション","AI エージェント","AI ツール"],"ko":["JSON 형식화 도구","월드빌딩 소프트웨어","JSON 출력 형식","유효한 JSON 출력","GUI 내보내기 형식","복수 컬렉션","AI 에이전트","AI 툴"],"es":["json-formatter","agentes de inteligencia artificial","formato de salida JSON","interfaz de usuario de Lore","compatibilidad con Lore","esquema de exportación","colecciones de entidades"],"fr":["json-formatter","outils d''intelligence artificielle","format de sortie JSON","interface utilisateur de Lore","compatibilité avec Lore","schéma d''exportation","collections d''entités"],"de":["json-formatter","KI-Tools","JSON-Ausgabeformatierung","Lore-Benutzeroberfläche","Kompatibilität mit Lore","Export-Schema-Format","Entitäten-Sammlungen"],"pt":["json-formatter","formatação de saída JSON","software de worldbuilding","Lore GUI","ferramentas de inteligência artificial","configuração de json-formatter","guias de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["json-formatter","форматирование JSON-выхода","программное обеспечение для создания миров","Lore GUI","ИИ Агенты","настройка json-formatter","руководства по разработке"],"ar":["json-formatter","تنسيق الإخراج JSON","برنامج بناء العالم","واجهة المستخدم Lore","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إعداد json-formatter","دلائل التطوير"]}},"owner":"bivex","repo":"loreSystem","repoPath":"bivex/loreSystem","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"json-formatter","description":"JSON formatting rules for lore entity output. Enforces export-compatible JSON, plural collections, consistent IDs, and domain field names.","bodyPreview":"# json-formatter\n\nBase skill for JSON output formatting. All extraction skills produce JSON that can be loaded by the Lore GUI (`LoreData.from_dict`).\n\n## Rules\n\n1. **Valid JSON**: Output must be parseable JSON — no trailing commas, no comments.\n2. **Export schema**: Use the GUI export format defined in `src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py`.\n3. **Plural collections**: Each entity collection is a top-level key with a plural name and an array value (e.g., `worlds`, `characters`, `locations`).\n4. **I","body":"# json-formatter\n\nBase skill for JSON output formatting. All extraction skills produce JSON that can be loaded by the Lore GUI (`LoreData.from_dict`).\n\n## Rules\n\n1. **Valid JSON**: Output must be parseable JSON — no trailing commas, no comments.\n2. **Export schema**: Use the GUI export format defined in `src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py`.\n3. **Plural collections**: Each entity collection is a top-level key with a plural name and an array value (e.g., `worlds`, `characters`, `locations`).\n4. **IDs are consistent**: Use integer IDs for GUI export collections. For entity types that use UUIDs in the domain model, use UUID strings consistently across references.\n5. **Field names**: Use exact domain field names (snake_case). Do not invent `type` or `entity_type` unless that field exists in the domain model.\n6. **Dates**: Use ISO 8601 strings for timestamps (`created_at`, `updated_at`, `start_date`, `end_date`).\n\n## Output Structure (Export-Compatible)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"worlds\": [],\n  \"characters\": [],\n  \"locations\": [],\n  \"quests\": [],\n  \"items\": [],\n  \"events\": [],\n  \"stories\": [],\n  \"storylines\": [],\n  \"tags\": [],\n  \"images\": [],\n  \"choices\": [],\n  \"flowcharts\": [],\n  \"handouts\": [],\n  \"inspirations\": [],\n  \"environments\": [],\n  \"banners\": [],\n  \"character_relationships\": [],\n  \"factions\": [],\n  \"shops\": [],\n  \"maps\": [],\n  \"notes\": [],\n  \"requirements\": [],\n  \"sessions\": [],\n  \"tokenboards\": [],\n  \"pity\": [],\n  \"pulls\": [],\n  \"player_profiles\": [],\n  \"currencies\": [],\n  \"rewards\": [],\n  \"purchases\": [],\n  \"event_chains\": [],\n  \"faction_memberships\": [],\n  \"lore_axioms\": [],\n  \"music_controls\": [],\n  \"music_states\": [],\n  \"music_themes\": [],\n  \"music_tracks\": [],\n  \"progression_events\": [],\n  \"character_states\": [],\n  \"textures\": [],\n  \"models\": [],\n  \"next_id\": 1\n}\n```\n\n## Required Fields (Core Entities)\n\nUse these minimum fields so JSON loads without validation errors:\n\n- **worlds**: `id`, `name`, `description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `version`\n- **characters**: `id`, `world_id`, `name`, `backstory`, `status`, `abilities`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `version`\n- **locations**: `id`, `world_id`, `name`, `description`, `location_type`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `version`\n- **quests**: `id`, `world_id`, `name`, `description`, `objectives`, `status`, `participant_ids`, `reward_ids`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `version`\n\nIf a field is unknown, set it to `null` or an empty list (for arrays), but keep the key.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:51.192Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Worldbuilding Agents needing standardized JSON output formatting for Lore GUI compatibility.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化JSON输出格式的Worldbuilding Agents，以便与Lore GUI兼容。","ja":"Lore GUIと互換性のある標準化されたJSON出力形式を必要とするWorldbuildingエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Lore GUI와 호환되는 표준화된 JSON 출력 형식을 필요로 하는 Worldbuilding 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Worldbuilding que necesitan un formato de salida de JSON estandarizado para la compatibilidad con la GUI de Lore.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de Worldbuilding ayant besoin d''un format de sortie JSON standardisé pour la compatibilité avec la GUI de Lore.","de":"Perfekt für Worldbuilding-Agents, die ein standardisiertes JSON-Ausgabeformat für die Kompatibilität mit der Lore-GUI benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Worldbuilding que necessitam de formatação de saída JSON padronizada para compatibilidade com a GUI Lore.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Worldbuilding, требующих стандартизированного формата вывода JSON для совместимости с GUI Lore.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Worldbuilding الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق إخراج JSON معياري لتوافق واجهة المستخدم Lore."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to produce parseable JSON with a defined export schema, utilizing the GUI export format and supporting plural collections, to seamlessly load data into the Lore GUI via LoreData.from_dict, leveraging JSON validation and export schema definition from src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py.","zh":"赋予代理生成带有定义导出模式的可解析JSON的能力，利用GUI导出格式并支持复数集合，以便通过LoreData.from_dict无缝地将数据加载到Lore GUI中，利用src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py中的JSON验证和导出模式定义。","ja":"エージェントが定義されたエクスポートスキーマを使用して解析可能なJSONを生成する能力を提供し、GUIエクスポート形式を使用して複数のコレクションをサポートし、LoreData.from_dictを使用してLore GUIにデータをシームレスにロードすることができ、src/presentation/gui/lore_data.pyからのJSONバリデーションとエクスポートスキーマ定義を活用する。","ko":"에이전트가 정의된 내보내기 스키마를 사용하여 파싱 가능한 JSON을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, GUI 내보내기 형식을 사용하여 복수 컬렉션을 지원하고, LoreData.from_dict를 사용하여 Lore GUI에 데이터를無縫로 불러올 수 있으며, src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py의 JSON 유효성 검사 및 내보내기 스키마 정의를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a producir JSON analizable con un esquema de exportación definido, utilizando el formato de exportación de la GUI y soportando colecciones plurales, para cargar datos de forma transparente en la GUI de Lore a través de LoreData.from_dict, aprovechando la validación JSON y la definición del esquema de exportación desde src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py.","fr":"Permet aux agents de produire du JSON analysable avec un schéma d''exportation défini, en utilisant le format d''exportation de la GUI et en prenant en charge les collections plurielles, pour charger les données de manière transparente dans la GUI de Lore via LoreData.from_dict, en exploitant la validation JSON et la définition du schéma d''exportation depuis src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, analysierbares JSON mit einem definierten Export-Schema zu erzeugen, indem es das GUI-Exportformat verwendet und plurale Sammlungen unterstützt, um Daten nahtlos in die Lore-GUI über LoreData.from_dict zu laden, indem es die JSON-Validierung und die Export-Schema-Definition aus src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a produzir JSON analisável com um esquema de exportação definido, utilizando o formato de exportação da GUI e suportando coleções plurais, para carregar dados na GUI Lore via LoreData.from_dict, aproveitando a validação JSON e a definição do esquema de exportação de src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью производить парсируемый JSON с определённой схемой экспорта, используя формат экспорта GUI и поддерживая множественные коллекции, для бесшовной загрузки данных в GUI Lore через LoreData.from_dict, используя валидацию JSON и определение схемы экспорта из src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل إمكانية إنتاج JSON قابل للتحليل مع مخطط تصدير محدد، باستخدام تنسيق تصدير واجهة المستخدم ودعم المجموعات المتعددة، لتحميل البيانات في واجهة المستخدم Lore عبر LoreData.from_dict، واستخدام التحقق من JSON وتنسيق مخطط التصدير من src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py."},"useCases":{"en":["Formatting JSON output for worldbuilding data","Generating valid JSON for Lore GUI data loading","Standardizing entity collections with plural names and array values"],"zh":["格式化世界构建数据的JSON输出","为Lore GUI数据加载生成有效的JSON","使用复数名称和数组值标准化实体集合"],"ja":["ワールドビルディングデータのJSON出力のフォーマット","Lore GUIデータロード用の有効なJSONを生成","複数名と配列値を使用してエンティティコレクションを標準化"],"ko":["월드빌딩 데이터의 JSON 출력 형식 지정","Lore GUI 데이터 로딩을 위한 유효한 JSON 생성","복수 이름과 배열 값을 사용하여 엔티티 컬렉션 표준화"],"es":["Formato de salida de JSON para datos de worldbuilding","Generación de JSON válido para la carga de datos de la GUI de Lore","Estandarización de colecciones de entidades con nombres plurales y valores de matriz"],"fr":["Formatage de la sortie JSON pour les données de worldbuilding","Génération de JSON valide pour le chargement de données de la GUI de Lore","Standardisation des collections d''entités avec des noms pluriels et des valeurs de tableau"],"de":["Formatierung der JSON-Ausgabe für Worldbuilding-Daten","Erzeugung von gültigem JSON für das Laden von Lore-GUI-Daten","Standardisierung von Entitätssammlungen mit pluralen Namen und Array-Werten"],"pt":["Formatação de saída JSON para dados de worldbuilding","Geração de JSON válido para carregamento de dados da GUI Lore","Padronização de coleções de entidades com nomes plurais e valores de matriz"],"ru":["Форматирование вывода JSON для данных worldbuilding","Генерация допустимого JSON для загрузки данных GUI Lore","Стандартизация коллекций сущностей с множественными именами и массивными значениями"],"ar":["تنسيق إخراج JSON لبيانات worldbuilding","توليد JSON صحيح لتحميل بيانات واجهة المستخدم Lore","تمييز مجموعات الكيانات بأسماء الجمع وقيم المصفوفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to valid JSON rules, no trailing commas or comments","Must use defined export schema from src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py"],"zh":["需要遵守有效的JSON规则，不允许有尾随逗号或注释","必须使用src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py中的定义导出模式"],"ja":["有効なJSONルールに従う必要があり、末尾のカンマやコメントは許可されない","src/presentation/gui/lore_data.pyからの定義されたエクスポートスキーマを使用する必要がある"],"ko":["유효한 JSON 규칙을 따라야 하며, 후행 쉼표 또는 주석은 허용되지 않음","src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py의 정의된 내보내기 스키마를 사용해야 함"],"es":["Requiere el cumplimiento de las reglas de JSON válidas, sin comas ni comentarios finales","Debe utilizar el esquema de exportación definido desde src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py"],"fr":["Nécessite le respect des règles de JSON valides, sans virgules ni commentaires finaux","Doit utiliser le schéma d''exportation défini depuis src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der gültigen JSON-Regeln, ohne abschließende Kommata oder Kommentare","Muss das definierte Export-Schema aus src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py verwenden"],"pt":["Exige aderência a regras JSON válidas, sem vírgulas ou comentários finais","Deve usar o esquema de exportação definido de src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения действительных правил JSON, без завершающих запятых или комментариев","Должно использовать определённую схему экспорта из src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بقواعد JSON صالحة، بدون فواصل أو تعليقات نهائية","يجب استخدام مخطط التصدير المحدد من src/presentation/gui/lore_data.py"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"db385588989bb1a4e1b774885598e6a456f0d795b87dde36dd987d0ce34111b7","qualityScore":54}');
